g she has ever  done in her career my dialogue was  patchwork together too with bits of  sentences constructed into sally speak  [Applause]  frankenweenie was tim burton's return to  the world of stop motion animation and  he was able to bring some of his  frequent collaborators with him winona  ryder was one of them who worked with  barton on films like beetlejuice and  edward scissorhands but you may know her  best from her role as joyce byers on  stranger things in frankenweenie ryder  voiced elsa van helsing the next door  neighbor and classmate of victor  frankenstein who in one particular scene  sings ryder actually got to work with  legendary composer danny elfman one on  one when recording her singing actually  work with him like directly just me and  him  was very exciting  12 years after the release of monsters  inc billy crystal reprised his role of  mike wazowski in the prequel monsters  university crystal has had an  illustrious career but out of all the  characters he has played crystal claims  that the short one-eyed monster is his  favorite character he's ever played  crystal loves the honesty and courage of  the character which made him jump at the  chance to play him again  this is gonna be harder than i thought  charlize theron is one of the most  popular actresses around the world and  her distinctive style and voice made her  the perfect fit as the addams family  matriarch morticia theron expressed her  admiration for the portrayal of morticia  in previous incarnations of the adams  family and described her as a stoic  loving and protective mother and wife  theron felt she didn't want to take away  what made morticia so special which led  her to embrace everything that made her  so popular in the first place  monsters vs aliens was actually reese  witherspoon's first ever animated film  which presented the oscar winner with  some challenges with her spoon was  unsure how she was supposed to act in  the film whether she was supposed to be  silly 